The Castle. Type help for the commands.
== gate ==
You stand at the castle gate. The road behind you is gone.
Exits: north.
== hall ==
A cold hall. Doors lead east and west, and the gate is south.
You see: bread.
Exits: south, east, west.
== kitchen ==
An old kitchen. Stairs go down into the dark.
You see: lamp.
Exits: west, down.
Taken: lamp.
You stopped in the kitchen after 2 moves.
